    ed_script_help_lua: 'Roblox-style Lua (sandboxed): Instance.new("Part"), workspace, game:GetService("Players" / "TweenService" / "RunService" / "UserInputService" / "Lighting" / "Debris" / "CollectionService"), task.wait / task.spawn, :Connect events, Touched, ClickDetector, ProximityPrompt, ScreenGui / TextLabel / TextButton, leaderstats. on("join"), command("name", fn), game.say... also work. 1 stud = 1 block.',
    ed_api_title: 'API reference (Roblox)',
    ed_api: '<p><b>Supported</b>: Instance.new / Clone / Destroy / FindFirstChild / WaitForChild / GetChildren / SetAttribute; Part (Position, Size, Color, Material, Shape, Transparency, Anchored, CanCollide, CFrame, Touched), PointLight, ClickDetector.MouseClick, ProximityPrompt.Triggered, SpawnLocation, Model:MoveTo; Players (LocalPlayer, PlayerAdded, CharacterAdded, Chatted, leaderstats), Humanoid (WalkSpeed, JumpPower, Health, Died); Workspace.Gravity; Lighting.ClockTime; TweenService:Create + TweenInfo + Enum.EasingStyle; RunService.Heartbeat / RenderStepped; UserInputService.InputBegan / IsKeyDown; ContextActionService:BindAction; Debris:AddItem; CollectionService; HttpService:JSONEncode / JSONDecode / GenerateGUID; BindableEvent; RemoteEvent (local); Value objects; ScreenGui, Frame, TextLabel, TextButton, UICorner, UIStroke, UIListLayout, UIPadding; Vector3, Vector2, Color3, CFrame, UDim2, BrickColor, Random, Enum; task.wait / spawn / delay / defer, wait, spawn, tick, os.time.</p><p><b>Differences</b>: 1 stud = 1 block (the character is 1.8 tall). Each player runs the script in their own browser (like a LocalScript): what the script creates is not shared with other players. Loose parts only fall to the ground or onto a block. WalkSpeed 16 and JumpPower 50 match the normal speed and jump.</p><p><b>Not available</b>: DataStores, real HTTP, Roblox models and MeshParts, animations, Terrain, full physics, Raycast, multi-file scripts (require).</p>',
